invariant: INV-16
file: tcp_nonblocking.c
catches: webpki_loop_aes
reason: the webpki ch_record_init hands the configuration hash 0 in place of
  the session's ch_cfg.cpu, so the hash runs on the portable code whatever
  the caller states (docs/decisions.md 132). test/webpki_ticket_rows.h
  reads the value the hash took and objects.

--- old
        webpki_ticket_config_hash(CH_CFG_CPU(r->t.cfg), cfg, r->t.ticket_config_hash);
--- new
        webpki_ticket_config_hash(0, cfg, r->t.ticket_config_hash);
